    "question": {
      ":question/id": "bbc7bcb1-d747-5813-8dd9-d9052bb456df",
      ":question/problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/generate/scratch/17592186096700/plots/0ce95abab9a44276358515f701157f0c88f73ca4ba8534958a2ac7ba34cf401a.png)\n\nConsider the diagram that is shown above. Which of the following statements are true?\n\n1. $b =-2e$\n2. $c =-d$\n3. $b = 2e$",
